{"id":"n66520-1-7","stage":5,"title":"악영향 · 坏影响","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66520-1-7-1","ko":"체벌의 심각한 악영향을 우려한 정부가 교사의 체벌을 금지하는 법안을 발효했어.","zh":"由于担心体罚会带来严重的不良影响，政府已经出台了禁止教师体罚的法案并已生效。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"체벌의","meaning":"体罚","explanation":"체벌：体罚；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"체벌","audio":"/audio/01b3b987341675946d48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79139","senseId":"1","lemma":"체벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심각한","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심각하다：严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심각하다","audio":"/audio/725518675d1ea82394eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64966","senseId":"1","lemma":"심각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"악영향을","meaning":"坏影响","explanation":"악영향：坏影响；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"악영향","audio":"/audio/04daba9d07465e19b083.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66520","senseId":"1","lemma":"악영향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우려한","meaning":"担忧，忧虑","explanation":"우려하다：担忧，忧虑；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"우려하다","audio":"/audio/4617ddb10f325e009f86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70370","senseId":"1","lemma":"우려하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정부가","meaning":"政府","explanation":"정부：政府；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정부","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31749","senseId":"2","lemma":"정부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교사의","meaning":"教师","explanation":"교사：教师；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"교사","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24037","senseId":"1","lemma":"교사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"체벌을","meaning":"体罚","explanation":"체벌：体罚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"체벌","audio":"/audio/01b3b987341675946d48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79139","senseId":"1","lemma":"체벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금지하는","meaning":"禁止","explanation":"금지하다：禁止；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"금지하다","audio":"/audio/6ae561cf0d709d2d5175.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61089","senseId":"1","lemma":"금지하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"법안을","meaning":"法案","explanation":"법안：法案；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"법안","audio":"/audio/845197b7a1e49317c8ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58932","senseId":"1","lemma":"법안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발효했어.","meaning":"生效","explanation":"발효하다：生效；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"발효하다","audio":"/audio/ec2495f5ff1d2531b112.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57988","senseId":"1","lemma":"발효하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01b3b98734167594","term":"체벌","zh":"体罚","audio":"/audio/01b3b987341675946d48.mp3","entryId":"79139","definition":"以抽打或罚跑操场等直接给身体造成痛苦的方式予以惩罚；或指那样的惩罚。","pronunciation":["체벌"]},{"id":"725518675d1ea823","term":"심각하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/725518675d1ea82394eb.mp3","entryId":"64966","definition":"状态或程度非常深刻、迫切或重大。","pronunciation":["심ː가카다"]},{"id":"04daba9d07465e19","term":"악영향","zh":"坏影响","audio":"/audio/04daba9d07465e19b083.mp3","entryId":"66520","definition":"不好的影响。","pronunciation":["아경향"]},{"id":"4617ddb10f325e00","term":"우려하다","zh":"担忧，忧虑","audio":"/audio/4617ddb10f325e009f86.mp3","entryId":"70370","definition":"操心或挂念。","pronunciation":["우려하다"]},{"id":"e471387df97978e2","term":"정부","zh":"政府","audio":"/audio/e471387df97978e2d0ff.mp3","entryId":"31749","definition":"负责行政的国家机构。","pronunciation":["정부"]},{"id":"df8671acdd670935","term":"교사","zh":"教师","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3","entryId":"24037","definition":"在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中等学校具备资格教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["교ː사"]},{"id":"6ae561cf0d709d2d","term":"금지하다","zh":"禁止","audio":"/audio/6ae561cf0d709d2d5175.mp3","entryId":"61089","definition":"以法律、条例或命令的形式不允许做某种行为。","pronunciation":["금ː지하다"]},{"id":"845197b7a1e49317","term":"법안","zh":"法案","audio":"/audio/845197b7a1e49317c8ae.mp3","entryId":"58932","definition":"将希望立法的事项分门别类整理好后提交到国会的文件或议案。","pronunciation":["버반"]},{"id":"ec2495f5ff1d2531","term":"발효하다","zh":"生效","audio":"/audio/ec2495f5ff1d2531b112.mp3","entryId":"57988","definition":"公约、法律或公文等发生效力；或指发出这种效力。","pronunciation":["발효하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b4b23e6399a07fd2453.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66520-1-7-2","ko":"난 동의할 수 없어. 오히려 교사의 체벌이 없으면 더 안 좋은 상황이 될 수도 있지 않을까?","zh":"我无法同意。相反，如果没有教师体罚，情况说不定会变得更糟呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동의할","meaning":"同意，赞同","explanation":"동의하다：同意，赞同；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"동의하다","audio":"/audio/5518dc49fcb84589609e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14815","senseId":"1","lemma":"동의하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오히려","meaning":"却，反而","explanation":"오히려：却，反而","readings":[{"term":"오히려","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22037","senseId":"1","lemma":"오히려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교사의","meaning":"教师","explanation":"교사：教师；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"교사","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24037","senseId":"1","lemma":"교사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"체벌이","meaning":"体罚","explanation":"체벌：体罚；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"체벌","audio":"/audio/01b3b987341675946d48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79139","senseId":"1","lemma":"체벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없으면","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，强","explanation":"좋다：好，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상황이","meaning":"状况，情况","explanation":"상황：状况，情况；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"상황","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16582","senseId":"1","lemma":"상황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수도","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않을까?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5518dc49fcb84589","term":"동의하다","zh":"同意，赞同","audio":"/audio/5518dc49fcb84589609e.mp3","entryId":"14815","definition":"持同样的意见。","pronunciation":["동의하다","동이하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"b499084b40ea381f","term":"오히려","zh":"却，反而","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3","entryId":"22037","definition":"与通常预期或期待相反或不同地。","pronunciation":["오히려"]},{"id":"df8671acdd670935","term":"교사","zh":"教师","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3","entryId":"24037","definition":"在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中等学校具备资格教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["교ː사"]},{"id":"01b3b98734167594","term":"체벌","zh":"体罚","audio":"/audio/01b3b987341675946d48.mp3","entryId":"79139","definition":"以抽打或罚跑操场等直接给身体造成痛苦的方式予以惩罚；或指那样的惩罚。","pronunciation":["체벌"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"946f8147acaaf499","term":"상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/51b052b6dd88271eea84.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":7.818,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66520","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":7.6447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我无法同意。相反，如果没有教师体罚，情况说不定会变得更糟呢。","据说最近邻国的渔民进入了我们的领海捕鱼。","由于担心体罚会带来严重的不良影响，政府已经出台了禁止教师体罚的法案并已生效。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我无法同意。相反，如果没有教师体罚，情况说不定会变得更糟呢。","由于担心体罚会带来严重的不良影响，政府已经出台了禁止教师体罚的法案并已生效。","据说最近邻国的渔民进入了我们的领海捕鱼。"],"answer":0}]}
